PZx------------	timeprogram 1-5 write
ZPx------------	timeprogram 1-5 read
-P-x-----------	0 active | 1 inactive
-P--x----------	0 off | 1 min | 2 med | 3 max
-P---x---------	0 in/out | 1 out | 2 in | 3 through
-P----x--------	0 MO | 1 DI | 2 MI | 3 DO | 4 FR | 5 SA | 6 SO | 7 MO-SO | 8 MO-FR | 9 SA-SO
